  unitName: Thunder Whip Orna
  unitId: 40493
  unitNumber: 724
  description: A magic using soldier from Mistral. Not only did she have impressive
    power and skill, but she was also quite beautiful. Though she declared that saving
    people in need was her pastime, she is mostly remembered for getting herself
    involved in situations that didn't concern her, and making them worse. Actually,
    when she tried to form a bond between the prince and princess of a pair of rival
    countries in order to end a war, she got herself caught in a huge scandal when
    the prince courted her instead of the princess. The war did eventually come to
    an end, but as the love triangle grew worse, she escaped to Morgan.
  summonDesc: I'm here!<br>You can call me<br>little miss Orna!
  fusionDesc: Hey!<br>Thanks a lot!<br>Hope today's a good day too!
